{"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"static","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"let","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"batchLimit","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/PropertyJSON\/documentation\/PropertyJSON\/BatchLimit","text":"BatchLimit","preciseIdentifier":"s:12PropertyJSON10BatchLimitV","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["Linux"]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"anchor":"discussion","level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Discussion"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The 100 events are what TelemetryDeck’s SwiftSDK sends in a request. The 333,333 bytes of an","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"event are a third of Ingest API v3’s limit: TelemetryDeck refuses a whole request when one","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"event’s JSON is over 1,000,000 bytes as its server writes it, which may be larger than the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"encoder’s, and a third leaves room for the escapes a re-encoder commonly adds, such as ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"\\u"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"and four hex digits for a character outside ASCII, and a space after each ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":":"},{"text":" and ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":","},{"text":". A","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"larger event is left out as ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/TelemetryDeckEncoding\/documentation\/TelemetryDeckEncoding\/TelemetryDeckEncodingError\/oversized(byteCount:)","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":".","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"TelemetryDeck documents no limit on a request; its 1,000,000 bytes are the encoder’s own","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"bound, the most one event may be, which keeps a request to a size a retry can send again.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"TelemetryDeck’s limits on one request: 100 events and 1,000,000 bytes of body, and 333,333"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"bytes of one event."}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/TelemetryDeckEncoding\/documentation\/TelemetryDeckEncoding\/TelemetryDeckBatchEncoder\/batchLimit","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"sections":[],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/telemetrydeckencoding\/telemetrydeckbatchencoder\/batchlimit"]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/TelemetryDeckEncoding\/documentation\/TelemetryDeckEncoding","doc:\/\/TelemetryDeckEncoding\/documentation\/TelemetryDeckEncoding\/TelemetryDeckBatchEncoder"]]},"metadata":{"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"static"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"let"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"batchLimit"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:12PropertyJSON10BatchLimitV","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"BatchLimit"}],"externalID":"s:21TelemetryDeckEncoding0aB12BatchEncoderV10batchLimit12PropertyJSON0dG0VvpZ","role":"symbol","symbolKind":"property","modules":[{"name":"TelemetryDeckEncoding"}],"roleHeading":"Type Property","remoteSource":{"fileName":"TelemetryDeckBatchEncoder.swift","url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/Traffluent\/blob\/main\/Sources\/TelemetryDeckEncoding\/TelemetryDeckBatchEncoder.swift#L134"},"title":"batchLimit"},"references":{"doc://TelemetryDeckEncoding/documentation/TelemetryDeckEncoding/TelemetryDeckEncodingError/oversized(byteCount:)":{"abstract":[{"text":"The event’s JSON is ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"byteCount"},{"text":" bytes, more than the encoder’s limit lets one record hold:","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"333,333 bytes by default (","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/TelemetryDeckEncoding\/documentat